<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-INDIA 66-1 AT CLOSE AGAINST JAMAICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 66-1 AT CLOSE AGAINST JAMAICA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 66 for one wicket at the close in reply to Jamaica's first innings total of 453 for nine declared on the second day of their four-day match at Sabina Park on Saturday.</p>
</text>
